<title>USA: Mississippi settles tobacco suit.</title>
<headline>Mississippi settles tobacco suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi Attorney General Mike Moore and the tobacco industry have settled the state's Medicaid lawsuit against cigarette companies, a source close to the negotiations said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Moore scheduled an afternoon news conference in Jackson, Miss., to announce the settlement, the source said. Moore's office had said on Wednesday that the attorney general had given the industry a deadline of Thursday to reach a deal or go to trial.</p>
</text>
